  "title": {
   "en": "Ouji Sama Wa Inma No Torikaekko Deshita Teishuku na Reijo Wo Dame Ni Suru Nyoro No Yuwaku"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "王子様は淫魔の取り替えっ子でした 貞淑な令嬢をダメにするニョロの誘惑"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Uptight Noble Lady and Her Flirtatious Prince"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Leticia, a plain and overly serious noble lady from a fallen house, is desperate to find a husband before it’s too late. Unfortunately, suitors are scarce… unless you count her childhood friend Ethelbert—a dashing prince with a reputation for womanizing and an infuriating habit of offering her unsolicited love advice.\n\nLeticia is convinced that someone as radiant and flirtatious as him could never truly love someone as dull and uptight as her. Yet, the more he teases her, the more her carefully guarded heart begins to waver.\n\nBehind his smirk lies a desire that’s anything but casual.\n\nCan a woman raised to be proper resist the sweet, sinful lessons of a prince with dangerous charm?",
   "ja": "地味で堅物な没落貴族令嬢・レティシアは年頃になっても嫁の行き先が決まらず焦っていた。そんな彼女にはエセルバートという幼馴染みがいる。彼は王子のうえ美男子でモテモテ。そのため次から次へ付き合う女性を変える浮気男だと言われている。顔を合わせるたびに行き遅れのレティシアに恋愛指南をしてくるエセルを憎々しく思いながらも、どこか心惹かれる彼女だが、自分とエセルは縁がないと思い込んでおり…!?\n王子様のエロスあふれる淫力に堅物令嬢は抗えるのか!?"
  },
